{
  "title": "Warm Spicy Brazilian Bean Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting lacto-vegetarian Brazilian stew featuring candied peel and a blend of spices, served in a stone bowl, perfect for a chilly evening.",
  "cuisine": "Brazilian",
